@startuml
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName "Helvetica"
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam roundCorner 8
skinparam shadowing false
autonumber

actor "Klient (Browser)" as Klient
participant "Caddy Reverse Proxy\n(HTTPS / TLS)" as Caddy
participant "PublicController\n(Litestar)" as Controller
participant "ContactService\n(Application Use Case)" as Service
participant "SqlAlchemyContactRepository\n(Infrastructure)" as Repo
database "PostgreSQL 16\n(asyncpg)" as DB
participant "IEmailService\n(SMTP / Mock)" as Mail
actor "Therapeutin\n(E-Mail Client)" as Therapist

Klient -> Caddy: POST /contact (Form Data: Name, Email, Phone, Msg, Honeypot)
activate Caddy
Caddy -> Controller: Proxy Request (ASGI)
activate Controller

Controller -> Service: submit_contact_form(CreateContactMessageDTO, client_ip)
activate Service

note over Service: 1. Anti-Spam Prüfung
alt Honeypot Feld ist ausgefüllt (Spam Bot)
    Service --> Controller: raise ValidationException("Spam submission detected")
    Controller --> Caddy: HTTP 200 (Render contact_form.html mit Fehler)
    Caddy --> Klient: HTMX Swap: Fehlermeldung anzeigen
else Gültige Anfrage
    note over Service: 2. Persistierung in PostgreSQL
    Service -> Repo: create_message(ContactMessage)
    activate Repo
    Repo -> DB: INSERT INTO contact_messages (id, sender_name, sender_email, ...)\nVALUES ($1, $2, $3, ...)
    activate DB
    DB --> Repo: Stored Record (UUID, Timestamps)
    deactivate DB
    Repo --> Service: ContactMessage Entity
    deactivate Repo

    note over Service: 3. Asynchrone Benachrichtigungen
    par E-Mail an Praxis
        Service -> Mail: send_contact_notification(ContactMessage)
        activate Mail
        Mail -> Therapist: SMTP Mail: Neue Anfrage von Klient
        Mail --> Service: OK
        deactivate Mail
    and Empfangsbestätigung an Klient
        Service -> Mail: send_contact_confirmation(ContactMessage)
        activate Mail
        Mail -> Klient: SMTP Mail: Empfangsbestätigung
        Mail --> Service: OK
        deactivate Mail
    end

    Service --> Controller: ContactMessageResponseDTO
    deactivate Service

    Controller --> Caddy: HTTP 200 (Template contact_success.html)
    deactivate Controller

    Caddy --> Klient: HTMX outerHTML Swap (Erfolgsanzeige im Browser)
    deactivate Caddy
end

@enduml
